repository-code: "https://github.com/jakbuczarnecki/intergrax"
url: "https://github.com/jakbuczarnecki/intergrax"
abstract: >-
  Intergrax is a Harness AI and Agent OS runtime for governed multi-agent systems
  in Python. It provides a four-tier platform (Platform, Nexus Agent OS, Agents,
  Applications), policy-first execution with observability and evaluation, and
  capability catalogs spanning integrations, tools, skills, RAG, memory, and
  multimodal modalities.
keywords:
